  "warnings": [
    "Explicit MPS2 AN521 layout: RAM capacities and aliases follow QEMU v10.0.13 mps2-tz.c an505_raminfo / AN521 initialization and armsse.c SSE-200 bank/alias definitions. This is an emulator model, not physical-board qualification.",
    "The NuttX linker region called flash is SSRAM0 in this QEMU machine. All resources declared here are RAM; no physical flash device is inferred.",
    "SSRAM1 and SSRAM2 form one contiguous 4 MiB resource coordinate space with two validated 2 MiB banks. This preserves allocator arenas and chunks spanning their bank boundary.",
    "Secure and nonsecure address windows describe shared storage, not current access permissions. MPC/SAU/IDAU state and CPU security state are not attested by this descriptor.",
    "Linked-load windows explicitly use the QEMU ARMv7-M ELF loader address map (PT_LOAD p_paddr); CPU and linked-load intervals sharing a backing are counted once. Startup copying and current byte contents are not observed.",
    "Unobserved banks and unowned bytes are unknown, not free heap. Full declared capacity does not establish that firmware allocators can use it.",
    "Layout applies to QEMU mps2-an521 v10.0.13 and NuttX 2b5c0de5e933281c209f954a63b99cf10c132346. Exact source URLs and scope are recorded in this descriptor's qualification object."
  ],
